  (4069, 'sentence', 'S000002693', 'ຂ້ອຍຢາກກິນໝູປີ້ງກັບເຂົ້າໜຽວ. I want to eat grilled pork with sticky rice.', 'SRC-AGENT:sequencing', 'derived', null),
