  (4206, 'sentence', 'S000002784', 'ຫຼວງພະບາງຢູ່ທິດເໜືອຂອງວຽງຈັນ. Luang Prabang is to the north of Vientiane.', 'SRC-AGENT:sequencing', 'derived', null),
