  (4208, 'sentence', 'S000002785', 'ເຈົ້າຮູ້ທິດທາງບໍ່? Do you know the way (direction)?', 'SRC-AGENT:sequencing', 'derived', null),
  (4209, 'sentence', 'S000002786', 'ເບິ່ງແຜນທີ່ເພື່ອຊອກທິດທາງ. Look at the map to find the direction.', 'SRC-AGENT:sequencing', 'derived', null),
